---
import BaseLayout from "../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
import "../styles/bloxfruit.css";

const novelTitle = "Infinite Mana in the Apocalypse";
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Novel Spec Scorecard Demo - LazyNoman"
  description="Refined webnovel review scorecard blending Blox Fruits arcade feel with LazyNoman theme"
  canonical="/bloxfruit-demo/"
>
  <div style="max-width: 860px; margin: 0 auto; padding: 2.5rem 1rem;">
    <header style="margin-bottom: 2rem;">
      <p
        style="color: var(--accent); font-weight: 700; font-size: 0.85rem; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.08em; margin-bottom: 0.5rem;"
      >
        Component Experiment · Ponytail Mixture
      </p>
      <h1 style="font-size: 2.2rem; margin: 0 0 0.5rem 0; font-weight: 700;">
        Novel Spec Scorecard
      </h1>
      <p style="color: var(--muted); font-size: 1rem; margin: 0;">
        Blended: Blox Fruits arcade pill-grid & rarity badges + LazyNoman's
        clean dark theme tokens.
      </p>
    </header>

    <!-- ================================================================= -->
    <!-- 1. REMADE HYBRID SCORECARD (RECOMMENDED MIXTURE)                  -->
    <!-- ================================================================= -->
    <section style="margin-bottom: 3.5rem;">
      <div
        style="display: flex; align-items: baseline; justify-content: space-between; margin-bottom: 0.5rem;"
      >
        <h2 style="font-size: 1.15rem; margin: 0; color: var(--text);">
          Option 1: Remade Editorial Hybrid Scorecard (Recommended)
        </h2>
        <span style="font-size: 0.8rem; color: var(--muted);"
          >Adapts to light & dark theme</span
        >
      </div>
      <p style="font-size: 0.9rem; color: var(--muted); margin-bottom: 1rem;">
        Uses <code>var(--surface)</code> and <code>var(--border)</code> for subtle
        contrast, replaces the harsh yellow gradient with our site accent, but preserves
        the Blox Fruits cell grid and glowing Mythical badge.
      </p>

      <div class="novel-spec-table">
        <div class="novel-spec-header">
          <div style="display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 10px;">
            <span
              style="display: inline-block; width: 8px; height: 8px; border-radius: 50%; background: var(--accent);"
            ></span>
            <h3>{novelTitle} — Review Scorecard</h3>
          </div>
          <span
            class="Bg(--Mythical) Bd(--Mythical) Bxsh(--Mythical) Traffic-03"
            style="padding: 3px 12px; border-radius: 999px; font-size: 0.8rem; letter-spacing: 0.5px;"
          >
            ★ MYTHICAL · 9.8 / 10
          </span>
        </div>

        <div class="novel-spec-grid">
          <div class="novel-spec-cell">
            <span class="novel-spec-label">Progression Pacing</span>
            <span class="novel-spec-value"
              >Exponential Growth · Instant Cheat</span
            >
          </div>

          <div class="novel-spec-cell">
            <span class="novel-spec-label">World Scope</span>
            <span class="novel-spec-value">Infinite Universes & Dimensions</span
            >
          </div>

          <div class="novel-spec-cell">
            <span class="novel-spec-label">Cheat System</span>
            <span class="novel-spec-value" style="color: #67e8f9;"
              >Infinite Mana Engine (0 MP / 0 CD)</span
            >
          </div>

          <div class="novel-spec-cell">
            <span class="novel-spec-label">Romance / Subplots</span>
            <span class="novel-spec-value"
              >Conquest Focused · Zero Melodrama</span
            >
          </div>

          <div class="novel-spec-cell">
            <span class="novel-spec-label">Protagonist Archetype</span>
            <span class="novel-spec-value"
              >Noah Osmont · Ruthless & Decisive</span
            >
          </div>

          <div class="novel-spec-cell">
            <span class="novel-spec-label">Length & Status</span>
            <span class="novel-spec-value">3,200+ Chapters · Ongoing</span>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="novel-spec-footer">
          <div style="font-size: 0.9rem; color: var(--muted);">
            <strong style="color: var(--text);">Verdict:</strong> Peak progression
            fantasy popcorn read. Mandatory if you love god-level OP MCs.
          </div>
          <a
            href="/infinite-mana-in-the-apocalypse/"
            class="bfw-button"
            style="padding: 6px 14px; min-height: 32px; font-size: 13px;"
          >
            Read Full Review →
          </a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- ================================================================= -->
    <!-- 2. COMPACT STAT TILES (MODULAR TECH VARIATION)                    -->
    <!-- ================================================================= -->
    <section style="margin-bottom: 3.5rem;">
      <h2 style="font-size: 1.15rem; margin: 0 0 0.5rem 0; color: var(--text);">
        Option 2: Compact Modular Stat Tiles
      </h2>
      <p style="font-size: 0.9rem; color: var(--muted); margin-bottom: 1rem;">
        Even lighter: minimal card shell with arcade-styled metric chips inside.
      </p>

      <div
        style="background: var(--surface); border: 1px solid var(--border); border-radius: 8px; padding: 1.25rem;"
      >
        <div
          style="display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center; border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border); padding-bottom: 0.75rem; margin-bottom: 1rem;"
        >
          <div>
            <span
              style="font-size: 0.75rem; text-transform: uppercase; color: var(--muted); font-family: VCR-OSD-Mono, monospace; font-weight: 700;"
              >Novel Specs</span
            >
            <h4
              style="margin: 2px 0 0; font-size: 1.1rem; color: var(--text); font-weight: 700;"
            >
              {novelTitle}
            </h4>
          </div>
          <span
            class="C(--Mythical) Traffic-03"
            style="font-size: 1.2rem; font-weight: bold;"
          >
            9.8 / 10
          </span>
        </div>

        <div
          style="display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(180px, 1fr)); gap: 8px; margin-bottom: 1rem;"
        >
          <div
            style="background: var(--surface-2); border: 1px solid var(--border); border-radius: 4px; padding: 8px 12px;"
          >
            <div
              style="font-size: 0.7rem; color: var(--muted); text-transform: uppercase; font-family: VCR-OSD-Mono, monospace;"
            >
              Pacing
            </div>
            <div
              style="font-size: 0.9rem; font-weight: 600; color: var(--text);"
            >
              Exponential
            </div>
          </div>
          <div
            style="background: var(--surface-2); border: 1px solid var(--border); border-radius: 4px; padding: 8px 12px;"
          >
            <div
              style="font-size: 0.7rem; color: var(--muted); text-transform: uppercase; font-family: VCR-OSD-Mono, monospace;"
            >
              Cheat
            </div>
            <div style="font-size: 0.9rem; font-weight: 600; color: #67e8f9;">
              Infinite Mana
            </div>
          </div>
          <div
            style="background: var(--surface-2); border: 1px solid var(--border); border-radius: 4px; padding: 8px 12px;"
          >
            <div
              style="font-size: 0.7rem; color: var(--muted); text-transform: uppercase; font-family: VCR-OSD-Mono, monospace;"
            >
              Chapters
            </div>
            <div
              style="font-size: 0.9rem; font-weight: 600; color: var(--text);"
            >
              3,200+
            </div>
          </div>
          <div
            style="background: var(--surface-2); border: 1px solid var(--border); border-radius: 4px; padding: 8px 12px;"
          >
            <div
              style="font-size: 0.7rem; color: var(--muted); text-transform: uppercase; font-family: VCR-OSD-Mono, monospace;"
            >
              Tier
            </div>
            <div
              style="font-size: 0.9rem; font-weight: 600; color: var(--Mythical-c);"
            >
              Mythical (SSS)
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div
          style="display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center; pt-2; font-size: 0.85rem; color: var(--muted);"
        >
          <span>Recommended for: <em>OP MC Enthusiasts</em></span>
          <button
            type="button"
            class="button1"
            style="padding: 5px 14px; font-size: 13px;"
          >
            Read Review
          </button>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- ================================================================= -->
    <!-- 3. ORIGINAL FLASHY WIKI TABLE (FOR DIRECT COMPARISON)              -->
    <!-- ================================================================= -->
    <details
      style="margin-top: 3rem; background: #161714; border: 1px dashed #4b493f; border-radius: 8px; padding: 1rem 1.25rem;"
    >
      <summary
        style="cursor: pointer; color: #ffd700; font-family: Traffic-03; font-size: 1rem;"
      >
        ▼ Compare with Original Flashy Wiki Table (Click to expand)
      </summary>

      <div style="margin-top: 1rem;">
        <p style="color: #9ca3af; font-size: 0.85rem;">
          Notice the difference: the original below used harsh solid black
          borders, pure yellow gradients, and heavy black drop-shadows that felt
          jarring on article prose.
        </p>

        <table class="bfw-table">
          <thead>
            <tr>
              <th colspan="2"
                >Infinite Mana in the Apocalypse — Original Wiki Style</th
              >
            </tr>
          </thead>
          <tbody>
            <tr>
              <td style="width: 50%;">
                <div class="bfw-table-cell">
                  <b>Progression Speed:</b> Instant Cheat / Exponential Growth
                </div>
              </td>
              <td style="width: 50%;">
                <div class="bfw-table-cell">
                  <b>World Scope:</b> Infinite Universes & Dimensional Realms
                </div>
              </td>
            </tr>
            <tr>
              <td>
                <div class="bfw-table-cell">
                  <b>Romance / Harem:</b> Conquest Focused (Zero Drama)
                </div>
              </td>
              <td>
                <div class="bfw-table-cell">
                  <b>Final Verdict:</b>
                  <span class="C(--Mythical) Traffic-03"
                    >9.8 / 10 · Must Read</span
                  >
                </div>
              </td>
            </tr>
          </tbody>
        </table>
      </div>
    </details>

    <footer style="margin-top: 3rem; text-align: center; font-size: 0.9rem;">
      <a href="/" style="color: var(--accent); font-weight: 600;"
        >← Back to LazyNoman Home</a
      >
    </footer>
  </div>
</BaseLayout>
